        <mxCell id="note" value="Shared source of truth: the topic flow and the assistant both read litigant_portal/corpus/,&#10;so improving a flow improves both surfaces. That is the green path, and it works.&#10;&#10;The red path is the mismatch. The prompt.md layers carry behaviour, not court facts, but they&#10;ride the evidence channel alongside the corpus, where the model is told to treat source content&#10;as evidence rather than instruction. So it quotes them instead of following them." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
